FOURTH AND GOAL FROM THE 1.     

00:10:32.697 --> 00:10:33.566 line:0%
TO MAKE SURE HE HAS THE LEAD.   
IAN: 19-YARDER.                 

00:10:35.034 --> 00:10:39.138 line:0%
HE NAILS IT.                    
BRONCOS GO IN FRONT, 20-17.     

00:10:40.606 --> 00:10:41.940 line:0%
5:07 REMAINING.                 
IT WAS THE FOURTH DOWN DECISION 

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:44.744 line:0%
IAN: FOURTH AND 6.              
HERBERT.                        

00:10:46.212 --> 00:10:48.914 line:0%
INTERCEPTED!                    
HE THREW IT RIGHT TO BRANDON    

00:10:50.382 --> 00:10:50.448 line:0%
JOBS.                           
-- BRENDAN JONES.               

00:10:51.283 --> 00:10:55.620 line:0%
DENVER TAKES OVER.              

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.622 line:0%
TAKE OVER INSIDE LOS ANGELES    
TERRITORY AT THE 34.            

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.424 line:0%
HANDOFF.                        
DOBBINS.                        

00:10:59.424 --> 00:11:01.627 line:0%
BIG HOLE.                       
FIRST DOWN.                     

00:11:03.095 --> 00:11:06.565 line:0%
HE ROLLS TO THE 21.             
13-YARD GAIN.                   

00:11:08.033 --> 00:11:09.235 line:0%
GOAL.                           
IAN: IN MOTION.                 

00:11:10.703 --> 00:11:12.237 line:0%
DOBBINS.                        
HAS A HOLE.                     

00:11:12.237 --> 00:11:17.442 line:0%
AND DOBBINS KEEPS ON CHUGGING.  
HE'LL COME UP SHORT OF THE FIRST

00:11:17.442 --> 00:11:18.778 line:0%
DOWN.                           
SO THE CLOCK WILL TICK AWAY     

00:11:22.681 --> 00:11:24.283 line:0%
36-YARDER.                      
ON TARGET.                      

00:11:25.751 --> 00:11:26.152 line:0%
23-17.                          
BRONCOS.                        

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.688 line:0%
1:08 TO PLAY.                   
SO THE CHARGERS ARE GOING TO GET

00:11:29.688 --> 00:11:29.889 line:0%
ACTUALLY, AS OPPOSED TO GIVING  
UP A BIG GAIN.                  

00:11:31.357 --> 00:11:33.426 line:0%
IAN: TO 30 SECONDS LEFT.        
HERBERT OVER THE MIDDLE.        

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.562 line:0%
IT'S HANDLED THERE BY           
VALDES-SCANTLING.               

00:11:38.096 --> 00:11:39.031 line:0%
BUT THE CLOCK CONTINUES TO ROLL.
WE'RE DOWN TO 22 SECONDS LEAVE. 

00:11:40.499 --> 00:11:42.635 line:0%
18 SECONDS.                     
HERBERT.                        

00:11:44.103 --> 00:11:48.641 line:0%
THROWS ON THE MOVE.             
CATCHES BY VALDES-SCANTLING.    

00:11:50.175 --> 00:11:51.510 line:0%
THEY'RE TRYING TO GET TO THE    
LINE.                           

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:51.577 line:0%
DESPERATION TIME FOR LA.        
HERBERT.                        

00:11:53.045 --> 00:11:53.846 line:0%
DEEP DROP.                      
STEPPING UP.                    

00:11:55.314 --> 00:11:57.583 line:0%
AND HERBERT IS DROPPED.         
GAME IS OVER!                   

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:04.189 line:0%
DENVER ENDS IT FITTINGLY WITH   
ITS DEFENSE!                    

00:12:04.189 --> 00:12:06.525 line:0%
JA'QUAN MCMILLIAN.              
THE CLOSER.                     

00:12:07.993 --> 00:12:08.127 line:0%
REFEREE: THIS IS THE END OF THE 
GAME.                           

00:12:09.294 --> 00:12:10.463 align:start position:0% line:0%
IAN: THE BRONCOS GET IT DONE.   
23-17.            

